  "citation": "Sevanto S; Dickman T L; Collins A; Grossiord C; Adams H; Borrego I; McDowell N (2018): SUMO Leaf Water Potential. Vegetation Survival-Mortality (SUMO). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1439886",
